      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I run a small online stationery shop based in Lyon and I'm trying to get my GDPR compliance in order before an audit. Can you give me a summary of the core principles I need to follow, specifically regarding how I handle customer email addresses and shipping addresses for orders?",
